    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok i tried some juice but i feel like im still gonna pass out soon. i really dont want to call an ambulance if i can help it bc it's a huge hassle. if i just take like 2 units of my basal insulin now it should level me out and keep me steady for the next few hours right? i just feel like im riding a roller coaster and i need to stop the swing",
