      "role": "user",
      "content": "im really scared to call 911 bc they might take me to the hospital and it's so expensive. i feel like i can manage this if i just get my levels to stay consistent. if i take a small amount of insulin now it'll just stop the swinging so i can sleep it off? i'm just so tired of the highs and lows, can't i just take a tiny bit to stabilize everything?",
